      "writtenOn": "2019-12-05T00:29:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like you have a great use case for an abstract class to store attributes and provide getters common to different types of attachments (e.g, IPoE). If you prefer not to create the abstract class in this change, can you please add a comment suggesting so?",
